      118.64,
      514.15,
      172.25
    ],
    "text": "Bulletin No: 07 MSW /26/11/02/01 COLOR: Red Warning for strong winds and rough seas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      15.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.64,
      172.82,
      421.92,
      234.65
    ],
    "text": "Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 10.30 a.m. 02 November 2026, valid for the next 24 hours. For: Multi-day boats in the Bay of Bengal deep sea areas and",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.64,
      237.65,
      555.65,
      344.57
    ],
    "text": "Deep sea areas off the coast extending from Mannar to Trincomalee via Kankasanthurai Take Action! The cyclonic storm \u201cMurasu\u201d has intensified into a Severe Cyclonic storm over the West central & adjoining Southwest Bay of Bengal. The system was located near latitude 13.9\u00b0N and longitude 81.8\u00b0E at 05.30 a.m. on 02 November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.64,
      353.21,
      555.44,
      382.01
    ],
    "text": "The Severe Cyclone Murasu is very likely to move northwestwards and cross south Andhra Pradesh coast during midnight of 2nd to early hours of 3rd November, 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.64,
      392.81,
      555.6,
      438.53
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category in the map below, may increase to (70-80) kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and these sea areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.64,
      449.45,
      555.62,
      495.07
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-17N and 80E-90E, until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.64,
      505.99,
      555.49,
      568.9
    ],
    "text": "Also, naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep sea areas off the coast extending from Mannar to Trincomalee via Kankasanthurai until further notice.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.64,
      881.88,
      553.75,
      944.4
    ],
    "text": "Naval and fishing communities engaging the activities over this sea area are advised to be vigilant and be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the department of meteorology in this regards.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
